            "review_title": "Review at Quán Mệ Toại - Hải sản Quảng Bình",
            "review_text": "Otosaigon\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam1 contribution\n0\nThe restaurant is crowded, fresh and the service is good\nFeb 2024 • Family\nThe restaurant is crowded, serving few people, so the food is slow to arrive. However, it was also enthusiastic and fun\nMy experience is to order suggested dishes from the restaurant to get them done quickly. Our group waited a bit too long for the grilled food\nFresh seafood, I found the squid and shrimp to be fresh. Grilled dishes are a bit greasy, taste delicious but are also a bit greasy\nGoing in a group, our group ordered a family meal, cooked in a Northern style and tasted very well\nRead more\nShow original\nWritten February 20, 2024",
            "rating": 5.0,
