            "review_title": "Review at Quán Mệ Toại - Hải sản Quảng Bình",
            "review_text": "Kristin Zachariassen\nOslo, Norway104 contributions\n0\nBy far the best food we have had in Vietnam!\nFeb 2024 • Couples\nWe fell into Quan Me Thai ( “ At my grandmothers) completely by accident, because a restless across the street from it was closed. And thank God for that! The absolutely best food we’ve had in Vietnam so far, including the Michelin recommendations that we went to in Saigon. We ordered a lot and had some fantastic scallops, seafood spring rolls, morning glory ( a vegetable that is a bit like spinach) with garlic, fried rice with dried scrimps and squid😋 All fantastic! Nice service and beer as well. You could consider going to Dong Hoi just to eat at Quan Me Toai!\nRead more\nWritten February 9, 2024",
